# Impeccable design-review skills. Local tooling: the engine ships a ~14MB
# platform binary, and none of it is deployed (the build whitelist covers only
# the web files, so nothing here reaches dist/). .github/ is the GitHub Copilot
# copy; .dsh/skills/ is the one DeepSeek Harness discovers (project root rank).
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.dsh/skills/
.impeccable/

